"Keep scanning" = "继续扫描";
"Recovering your position" = "正在恢复定位";
"Recording is paused. Saved photos are safe; capture resumes when your position is stable." = "录制已暂停。已保存的照片不会丢失；位置稳定后会继续拍摄。";
"Return to this view and pan slowly." = "回到这个视角并缓慢平移。";
"Save what I have" = "保存已有内容";
"Photo detail" = "照片覆盖";
"Photo detail, %lld percent of observed surfaces" = "照片覆盖：已观测表面的 %lld%%";
"%lld walls measured" = "已测得 %lld 面墙";
"Starting LiDAR…" = "正在启动 LiDAR…";
"1 room · %lld photos" = "1 间房 · %lld 张照片";
"%lld rooms · %lld photos" = "%lld 间房 · %lld 张照片";
"Name the room to start" = "为房间命名以开始";
"Which room are you in?" = "你在哪个房间？";
"Walk into the next room, then start it. Stay in this session so the rooms line up." = "走进下一个房间再开始。保持在同一个会话里，这样房间才能对齐。";
"Review saved room in 3D" = "以 3D 查看已保存房间";
"Inspect the textured scan before leaving. Use coverage colours in the preview to check gaps." = "离开前先检查带纹理的扫描。用预览里的覆盖颜色检查缺口。";
"Scan each room once: as you move, a triangle mesh appears. **Green** means good photo coverage, including aligned earlier scans. **Red** needs more photos. Areas without triangles still need scanning. The white outlines are the walls, doors and windows being measured. **Photo detail** measures photography on surfaces already seen by LiDAR; it is not the percentage of the room scanned. Save and review for missing areas." = "每个房间只扫一次：移动时会出现三角网格。**绿色**表示照片覆盖良好，包括已对齐的早期扫描。**红色**表示还需要更多照片。没有三角形的区域仍需扫描。白色轮廓是正在测量的墙、门和窗。**照片覆盖**衡量的是 LiDAR 已看到的表面上的摄影情况，不是已扫描房间的百分比。保存并检查缺失区域。";
"Come back any time and tap **Scan a room**, or open a saved room and choose **Continue scanning from this room**. Share from the house screen (AirDrop the .zip to your Mac)." = "随时回来，点 **扫描房间**，或打开已保存的房间并选择 **从这个房间继续扫描**。在房屋界面分享（用隔空投送把 .zip 发到你的 Mac）。";
"Finish room and save what is available" = "完成房间并保存已有内容";
"Finish room ✓" = "完成房间 ✓";
"Save room" = "保存房间";
"Finish session" = "结束会话";
"Finish and keep saved rooms" = "完成并保留已保存房间";
"Take reference photo" = "拍摄参考照片";
"Reducing background capture to keep scanning responsive." = "正在降低后台拍摄以保持扫描流畅。";
"Redo last room" = "重做上个房间";
"High-resolution automatic photos" = "高分辨率自动照片";
"Regular photos use camera frames for a lighter scan. High-resolution photos add processing and are limited to one request every 3 seconds while the phone is cool. The shutter always saves a regular photo." = "常规照片使用相机画面，扫描更轻量。高分辨率照片会增加处理负担，手机不热时每 3 秒限拍一张。快门每次都会保存一张常规照片。";
"Scan ended" = "扫描已结束";
"The phone lost its position. The available room data has been saved. Finish this session, then start a new capture from the house screen." = "手机丢失了定位。已有的房间数据已保存。请结束这个会话，然后从房屋界面开始新的拍摄。";
"This scan is saved. Finish this session, then tap Scan a room to continue with a fresh capture." = "这次扫描已保存。请结束这个会话，然后点“扫描房间”开始全新拍摄。";
"Earlier scan" = "之前的扫描";
"Map not saved" = "地图未保存";
"Keep this screen open while freeing storage, then retry. Files already written are kept." = "清理存储空间时保持这个界面打开，然后重试。已写入的文件会保留。";
"Retry saving" = "重试保存";
"Couldn't save the scan" = "无法保存扫描";
"Paused" = "已暂停";
"No photos, depth or coverage while paused. Tracking keeps running: keep the camera pointed at the room (not the floor or your pocket) so it doesn't lose its place." = "暂停时不拍照片、不记深度和覆盖。追踪仍在运行：请把相机对准房间（不要对着地面或口袋），以免丢失位置。";
"Aim at walls and furniture you scanned before (not just the floor)." = "对准你之前扫描过的墙和家具（不要只对着地面）。";
"Now pan across a corner, a door frame or some furniture: one flat wall can't show whether it's slid sideways." = "现在平移扫过一个墙角、门框或一件家具：一面平墙看不出是否横向滑移了。";
"Spots you scanned before:" = "你之前扫描过的位置：";
"Still can't find where you are." = "仍然找不到你的位置。";
"Keep trying" = "继续尝试";
"Start a fresh scan" = "开始全新扫描";
"• Bare walls and floors don't work; aim at shelves, pictures, door frames." = "• 光秃秃的墙和地面不行；对准架子、画、门框。";
"• Stand where you scanned before, like a doorway or a corner with furniture, 1–2 m back, and pan slowly." = "• 站在你之前扫描过的位置，比如门口或有家具的墙角，退后 1–2 米，缓慢平移。";
"• Things moved since last time? Aim at something that didn't." = "• 上次之后有东西动过？对准没动过的东西。";
"• Turn on the same lights as last time." = "• 开和上次一样的灯。";
